{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019100/extras/eb0a1a29e586130748578c6b84676418.avif?t=1758375871\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sands of Time</strong> opens a forbidden chapter in the saga of <i>Elleria</i>, bridging the end of Book I into the dawn of Book II.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Eliot Magnus and Amynth are drawn into the desert wastes, where the rogue Tha\u2019shir tribes unearth powers that should have remained sealed. These tribes \u2014 heirs to an ancient, blood-soaked civilization \u2014 wield rites that bend the sands of time itself. Their sacrifices call to forgotten gods, and their tampering threatens to unravel the balance between mortality and divinity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The desert holds ruins older than memory, marked by ritual altars, obsidian machines, and whispers of a people who walked both in blood and in shadow. Every step deeper drags Eliot closer to truths that cannot be unseen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This DLC features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A darker, more relentless story where time itself becomes a weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded lore of the Tha\u2019shir \u2014 a civilization steeped in sacrifice, secrets, and forbidden knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 new soundtracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple animations for additional immersion for this journey through sand and time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The sands shift, the blood spills, and the hourglass cracks. Some 